  "notes": "The released size (550B total, 55B active) differs from the approximate size in the December 2025 announcement (about 500B, up to 50B active). NVIDIA calls it the final model of the Nemotron 3 family and says it was built with contributions from the Nemotron Coalition. The API id nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b is the build.nvidia.com model path linked from the model card. The research page also lists a GenRM checkpoint used for RLHF; it is not a variant. Technical report: https://research.nvidia.com/labs/nemotron/files/NVIDIA-Nemotron-3-Ultra-Technical-Report.pdf."
